        {
          "id": "1795857654599852392",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "3/ We eval'd many of the leading models:\n\n- GPT-4o\n- GPT-4 Turbo\n- Claude 3 Opus\n- Gemini 1.5 Pro\n- Gemini 1.5 Flash\n- Llama3\n- Mistral Large\n\nOn Coding, Math, Instruction Following, and Multilinguality (Spanish).\n\nSee leaderboard results below. https://t.co/Z3rTCCVCaP",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1795857656374087970"
    },
    {
