        "reply_count": 67,
        "retweet_count": 208
      },
      "text": "1/ We are launching SEAL Leaderboards—private, expert evaluations of leading frontier models.\n\nOur design principles:\n🔒Private + Unexploitable. No overfitting on evals!\n🎓Domain Expert Evals\n🏆Continuously Updated w/new Data and Models\n\nRead more in 🧵\n\nhttps://t.co/10nk53awrL https://t.co/MZZQX0KDc9",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1795857651592491281"
