        "text": "Even with the sneaky 98% output token price increase on Flash, it's 95% confidence interval overlapping with Claude Opus on coding based on domain expert evaluation is crazy town given the price difference. Opus is $15/$75; Gemini 1.5 Flash is $0.35/$1.05; 42.8x/71.4x cheaper https://t.co/lLuAjYmZkr https://t.co/aAU53peIsY"
